8PniFLFMWIrFZ4jpjc0qTLeNBg&oe=69A02FB8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "aplb - landscape.png", "id": "527063225481667", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982447_527063228815000_4775485127065302087_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zbigKfmFrHQQ7kNvwHK4KMI&_nc_oc=AdlYgkJg3mhFyg0e8WKkjh5qsY8t_Jmy0jnE2tBuVKm9KStqDflR-mgFrDjbl8IKMDI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs_y7BdXW-cH1PWrZRgV7DSUeif8ht4bHFEkTjFDqrEsA&oe=69A05D27"}, "display_name": "Coffin Rot Brewing Co.", "keywords": ["bartending", "simulation", "casual", "undead", "survival"], "long_description": "#                                                                                                                                                                                                      \n{1277620144082023}\n**The Tavern of Lost Souls is Now Open**\n\nExperience an intense and immersive dive into the watery underworld of pirate bartending!\n{2277648556027621}\n**Protect your Booty**\n\nBuild out your tavern, raise your fortunes, strengthen your firepower! Lest we forget -- greed in this world can never be sated. \n\n{1865364164309039}\n**The Dreaded Debt Collector is Coming. Will you be Prepared?**\n\nDown here, new management means nothing to those still collecting on the debt of your infamous, tomb-sunken father!\n{1303513374821869}", "short_description": "Pick up where your father left off -- bartending for the undead! It's not all sloshing grog and wiping tables at this bar because your dad also left you a considerable debt, and someone's coming to collect...\n"}]}, "developer_name": "Nooner Bear Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.clique.games/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Clique Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://clique.games/coffinrot", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags